{"t":"say","text":"Integrating the AI Shopping Assistant using Model Studio and vector search."}
{"t":"node","id":"model-studio","product":"model_studio","label":"Model Studio (Qwen)","group":"region-sg","why":"LLM APIs for conversational shopping assistance"}
{"t":"node","id":"dashvector","product":"dashvector","label":"DashVector","group":"region-sg","why":"Vector database for RAG over product descriptions"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-fc-ms","from":"fc-chatbot","to":"model-studio","label":"Chat Completion"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-fc-dv","from":"fc-chatbot","to":"dashvector","label":"Vector Search"}
{"t":"say","text":"Storing product images and static assets in object storage."}
{"t":"node","id":"oss","product":"oss","label":"OSS Bucket","group":"region-sg","why":"Durable storage for millions of product images"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-oss","from":"esa","to":"oss","label":"Origin Pull"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sae-oss","from":"sae-web","to":"oss","label":"Upload/Meta"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding essential operational and security controls."}
{"t":"node","id":"sls","product":"sls","label":"Simple Log Service","group":"region-sg","why":"Centralized logging for apps, WAF, and ESA"}
{"t":"node","id":"arms","product":"arms","label":"ARMS","group":"region-sg","why":"APM tracing for SAE and FC latency analysis"}
{"t":"node","id":"cloud-firewall","product":"cloud_firewall","label":"Cloud Firewall","group":"vpc-main","why":"North-south and east-west traffic control within VPC"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-sae-sls","from":"sae-web","to":"sls","label":"Logs"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-fc-sls","from":"fc-chatbot","to":"sls","label":"Logs"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Highly available cross-border e-commerce architecture on Alibaba Cloud Singapore, featuring SAE for elastic scaling, PolarDB/Tair for data, Elasticsearch for search, and Model Studio/DashVector for the AI chatbot, secured by ESA/WAF."}

